 this, she wears a loose-fitting, long-sleeved white garment, possibly a shirt or robe, which is draped casually over her shoulders. The contrast between the sleek black and the soft white creates a visually striking and balanced look.\n\n**Setting & Lighting:**\nThe background is softly blurred and luminous, with warm, diffused lighting that suggests an indoor setting, perhaps a room with large windows or ambient evening glow. Subtle bokeh effects—soft, out-of-focus circles of light—dot the background, enhancing the dreamy, ethereal atmosphere. The lighting on the subject is flattering, with gentle highlights on her cheekbones, nose, and hair, creating a three-dimensional effect.\n\n**Mood & Style:**\nThe overall mood of the image is serene, joyful, and sophisticated. The style blends realism with stylized artistry, characteristic of modern digital"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 112, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [335.69232177734375, 149.33335876464844], "pos": [3309.707275390625, 3522.478271484375], "id": 82, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [119], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "原始大小", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "links": [127], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [128], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "crop", "lanczos", "8", "longest", 1920, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 117, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "lab